==English==

===Etymology===
[[respelling|Respelling]] of {{term|damn|lang=en}} to reflect the [[emphatic]] stress and a southern African American accent.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈdæ̙jəm]|['deəjəm]|lang=en}}

===Interjection===
{{en-interj|head=dayum!}}

# {{context|slang|emphatic|lang=en}} {{eye dialect of|damn|from=Southern US|lang=en}}
#: ''Oh, man, did you ''see'' her?! '''Dayum!''' She was hella fine!''